  dialogueText: 'When talking about a group of people, Ilokano can use ''da'' as
    a plural marker.

    For example, when referring to a group such as the weavers,
    ''da'' can help indicate that you''re talking about more than one person.

    Now,
    try saying ''da'' yourself.'
